general_sandbox_preflight returns &'static Result<(), String> and the String is now interpolated, so the next occurrence on native Windows will carry the cause through the probe as this bead requires.

What remains is only the second half: reproduce on native Windows and fix the demonstrated cause. That needs a native Windows host, so it cannot be completed from macOS; the useful next step is to wait for or force a recurrence now that the diagnostic survives, rather than to guess at the cause.

